title: "Map Reader LLM: Automated Archaeological Feature Extraction Pipeline"
version: 4.2.0
date-released: 2026-01-23
url: "https://github.com/saross/map-reader-llm"
repository-code: "https://github.com/saross/map-reader-llm"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  An automated pipeline for extracting archaeological features (specifically "Burial Mounds" or Tumuli) 
  from historical Soviet 1:50,000 topographic maps using Multimodal Large Language Models (Google Gemini). 
  The system handles tiling, VLM inference, and geospatial reconstitution.
keywords:
  - archaeology
  - remote sensing
  - machine learning
  - computer vision
  - LLM
  - Gemini
  - Tundzha Regional Archaeology Project
